==Spanish==

===Etymology===
From {{der|es|LL.|mātrīcāria||related to the womb}}, from {{der|es|la|mātrīx||womb}}. The semantic development could mirror the one in {{m|la|cunīculus||underground tunnel; rabbit}} if indeed related to {{m|la|cunnus||vagina}}.

